TLS: no TLS library is included. HTTPS goes through the host's own libcurl,
loaded dynamically at run time: on macOS /usr/lib/libcurl.4.dylib, part of
the operating system; on linux libcurl-gnutls.so.4 (curl built against
GnuTLS, LGPL-2.1-or-later), as Debian and Ubuntu link their own git.

